   "end": 4.655,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "b03",
   "section": "short-bea",
   "text": "But Bea has a system.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 5.105,
   "end": 6.607,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "section": "short-bea",
   "text": "Every month, a set amount goes into a pot just for experiences.",
